HTTPS injection for --secret, ai-jail 3.7.1 (from the fork's
feat/secret-tls-inject, on branch zeo/ebuild-371): a per-launch CA, kept in
memory and name-constrained to the bound hosts, lets the egress proxy put the
real value into HTTPS requests to them; --secret KEY=host[,host...], a
per-launch placeholder, Basic auth, chunked bodies, smuggling-safe framing.
Adds rcgen. Must follow ai-jail-host-ports.patch.

